Uninstall an inactive component package

Usage:
  eshu component uninstall <component-id> [flags]

Flags:
      --component-home string   Component registry home directory
  -h, --help                    help for uninstall
      --json                    Write stable JSON output
      --version string          Component version to uninstall

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
